     "text": "Subjects will remain supine for at least 5 minutes prior to recording 12-lead electrocardiogram (ECG). Screening 12-lead ECG will be recorded prior to hemodialysis. The Day -2 12-lead ECG will be recorded within 4 hours after hemodialysis rinse back. After the last dose of investigational product on Day 27, 12-lead ECGs will be recorded between 18 and 30 hours (recorded on day 28) post-dose."
